01:04:07.200 --> 01:04:08.233
Iya, iya...

01:04:09.266 --> 01:04:11.033
Kamu suka yang ini, kan?

01:04:47.000 --> 01:04:48.433
Iya, iya...

01:04:56.900 --> 01:04:59.500
Jangan, jangan... kumohon, kumohon.

01:05:16.933 --> 01:05:20.000
