01:36:43.600 --> 01:36:45.600
Bisa digerakin sendiri, kan?

01:36:57.033 --> 01:36:58.200
Coba digerakin, ya.

01:37:09.200 --> 01:37:10.766
Aku putar ke sini.

01:37:27.900 --> 01:37:29.866
