Bersihin, dong.

01:38:11.733 --> 01:38:12.733
Bersihin.

01:38:31.400 --> 01:38:33.700
Ber-

01:39:14.733 --> 01:39:20.733
si-

01:40:48.200 --> 01:40:49.333
hin, ya.

