Maaf, ya.

01:41:45.933 --> 01:41:46.933
Maaf, ya.

01:42:22.333 --> 01:42:23.733
Ma-

01:42:29.166 --> 01:42:30.366
af,

01:42:37.600 --> 01:42:39.166
ya.

01:43:33.800 --> 01:43:35.200
Biarin aku lakuin dengan bener.

