02:12:35.600 --> 02:12:36.600
Sini.

02:12:38.100 --> 02:12:39.533
Jangan, jangan, jangan.

02:12:46.966 --> 02:12:48.433
Gak apa-apa, kok. Pergelangan tanganmu terlalu kaku.

02:13:27.033 --> 02:13:28.033
Rasanya enak banget.

02:13:29.700 --> 02:13:30.433
Bukan, bukan gitu.

02:13:30.600 --> 02:13:32.166
Bisa-bisa dia langsung keluar kalau begini.

02:14:05.833 --> 02:14:07.200
